      "body_plain": "I want to show the mean value of the left-right classification per Country and to show this on a world map.\n\nIts the world value Survey Round 6. Its v2 for countrycode and v95 for the left right classification.\n\n>",
      "body_snippet": "I want to show the mean value of the left-right classification per Country and to show this on a world map.\n\nIts the world value Survey Round 6. Its v2 for countrycode and v95 for the left right class",
      "thread_id": "thread-12e8a8ce0e2b",
