      "body_plain": "Hi,\n\nI am currently trying to plot locations from longitude -170 to 170, near Alaska. Right now I am having issues setting the boundary range for the produced image; no matter what I do the whole world will be in the plotted background. I have attached image 4722865_Magnitude=7.9.map.png to show the result; one point is on one side of the map, while the others are clustered on the extreme opposite end.\n\nI would like my result to be something similar in image 20020622R_Magnitude=6.2.map.png.\n\nSorry if my question is confusing or unclear, or if this is was a stupid question.\n\nThanks in advance!\n-Jay",
